攝)\"><figcaption>其中一名傷者由救護車送院。(李家傑攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260521/1134275854831456256946250.jpeg/DqipKTmWPiTHtf1LHzpm2kI5BWbFQKeIJtsjtwPbI7c\" alt=\"消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。\"><figcaption>消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260521/1134275843695054848402395.jpeg/kSL9f5avHoltA53BzgBuPJpHuEattOLK9_DGNdLwxjU\" alt=\"消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。\"><figcaption>消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134283449755111424562917.jpeg/YJlfaVmwh7Mfz_JZPKw1cPdye-egnI4obchjlVjIY5U\" alt=\"消防員及警員協助疏散住客，部份人需用助行架協助離開。（李家傑攝）\"><figcaption>消防員及警員協助疏散住客，部份人需用助行架協助離開。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260521/1134275846698307584812056.jpeg/ukJI8ojAvN2Du-KBuWWYJInJaTYSWcJWskzA-5dMwPs\" alt=\"消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。\"><figcaption>消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260521/1134275852268605440837560.jpeg/56eNhsGpLnf3Oyrv2CGYU__1l8udWUvH5iP4qcMj-Kk\" alt=\"消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。\"><figcaption>消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260521/1134275846966743040536470.jpeg/TBjDP7pGThbf_xFqbiof51ftHM4dTMPs7_DRuMrw0bg\" alt=\"消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。\"><figcaption>消防員及警員協助疏散住客。部份受傷人士由救護員在場治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134284073544454144168973.jpeg/eUeweyzdlylcvQITnKKmpsg63xQ5k8N_9f5zBMD-cwQ\" alt=\"過百人需要疏散。（李家傑攝）\"><figcaption>過百人需要疏散。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134283228484472832847059.jpeg/pI7KXUXe16QVsmc1z2EE3eIhFcglD1w7-qXBys-lwco\" alt=\"其中一名傷者由救護車送院，須戴上氧氣罩。(李家傑攝)\"><figcaption>其中一名傷者由救護車送院，須戴上氧氣罩。(李家傑攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260522/1134368201610629120920574.jpeg/PwnPmOMOeaMRxEKUnoPuJSCOGQIxGFeclzKE9aIyhPU\" alt=\"遺體凌晨由仵工移走。\"><figcaption>遺體凌晨由仵工移走。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-22T04:43:31.587257+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1192,"images":22,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}